	<section_number>24.2-416.1</section_number>
	<catch_line>Voter registration by mail</catch_line>
	<text>
		A person may apply to register to vote by mail by completing and returning a mail voter registration application form in the manner and time provided by law.
	</text>
	<history>1996, cc. 72, 73; 2003, c. 1015; 2020, cc. 718, 1149, 1151, 1201; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 471.</history>
</law>
